       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SCULPT-TOOLS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SCULPT-TOOLS-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PULL-EXPANSION-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PUSH-COMPRESS-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SLICE-CLEAVE-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SMOOTH-PINCH-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SCULPT-TOOLS-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SCULPT-TOOLS-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-TOOLS-PROVEN         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-TOOLS-CODE         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PULL-AND-PUSH.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SLICE-AND-SMOOTH.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-TOOLS-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PULL-AND-PUSH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PULL-EXPANSION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PUSH-COMPRESS-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SLICE-AND-SMOOTH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SLICE-CLEAVE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SMOOTH-PINCH-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-TOOLS-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PULL-EXPANSION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PUSH-COMPRESS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SLICE-CLEAVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SMOOTH-PINCH-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SCULPT-TOOLS-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-TOOLS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-TOOLS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-TOOLS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-TOOLS-CODE.
